  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Standalone image preparation and multipart-backed assets\n- CreateAssetWithAdjustments validates an image and attempts one suggested resize, returning an AssetAndStateReference without registering it.\n- Unchanged images remain file-backed; resized images become byte-backed PNG assets. Both support multipart upload through JRK.JevRunner. Keep file-backed sources available until execution completes.\n- Register prepared assets manually with AddAssetStateAndReference, or expose them as generated query properties with AssetState.\n- Breaking: AddImageAssetWithAutoAdjustment is now synchronous; remove await from existing calls.\n- Asset.ReadAsBytes reads inline or stream-backed image contents and disposes opened streams.\n- Adjusted output is not revalidated; preparation does not guarantee API acceptance or check request-wide limits.",
